# FunHub Product Requirements Document (PRD)

## Product Name

FunHub

## Product Vision

To become Africa's most trusted platform for discovering, planning, booking, and sharing entertainment experiences.

## Mission

To remove the stress of planning fun by connecting customers with entertainment businesses through one intelligent platform.

---

# Problem Statement

## Customer Problems

Customers currently struggle with:

- Finding quality entertainment locations.
- Knowing which places are worth visiting.
- Comparing entertainment options.
- Planning complete outings.
- Booking experiences easily.
- Finding offers and discounts.

## Business Problems

Entertainment businesses struggle with:

- Getting enough publicity.
- Reaching new customers.
- Managing customer enquiries.
- Increasing revenue.
- Managing bookings and promotions.

---

# Solution

FunHub provides one platform where users can:

- Discover entertainment locations.
- Search by proximity.
- Compare experiences.
- Make reservations.
- Purchase tickets.
- Review businesses.
- Share experiences.
- Follow other users.

Businesses can:

- Advertise.
- Manage bookings.
- Promote offers.
- Communicate with customers.
- View analytics.

---

# User Types

## Customer

A person searching for entertainment experiences.

Capabilities:

- Search locations.
- View businesses.
- Make bookings.
- Write reviews.
- Share experiences.

---

## Business Owner

A company owner managing entertainment businesses.

Capabilities:

- Register business.
- Add branches.
- Create promotions.
- Manage bookings.
- View analytics.

---

## Business Staff

Employees managing daily operations.

Capabilities:

- Handle customer requests.
- Confirm bookings.
- Assist customers.

---

## FunHub Administrator

Manages the entire platform.

Capabilities:

- Verify businesses.
- Manage users.
- Monitor activity.
- Manage payments.

---

